  "coverageNotes": [
    "This pinned MorphGNT stream predates SBLGNT v1.2 (July 2023) and is not the latest SBLGNT text. John 7:53-8:11 is absent.",
    "References use the pinned stream's numbering, which is not interchangeable with every edition: for example, Romans ends at reference 16:24. This does not establish that text found under other numbering is absent.",
    "Coverage records source references and numeric gaps within observed chapters, not all traditional verses or manuscript readings. No missing text or annotations are supplied.",
    "Morphology and lexical lemmas are scholarly annotations, not infallible contextual interpretations. Strong's linkage is unresolved and remains empty.",
    "Source spelling, punctuation, editorial marks, POS and eight-position parsing are preserved without Unicode normalization. These data licenses do not assign an application-code license."
  ],
